# prefs: factory
# A camera on the menu bar's right takes a screenshot.
#
# The Tiku menu already had a Take Screenshot item; this is the same
# thing as a button a person can see and reach: a small camera at the
# far right of the bar, saving to ~/Pictures.  The shot is taken next
# turn so the pointer's press is not frozen into it.
wait 40
click 979 8
wait 40
expect-read status screenshot saved
